{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:22:02+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Epic Party Quest", "steam_appid": 2024810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2695380], "detailed_description": "<h1>Keyboard Controls in Demo</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/358a3a2b3ab2c74029f6282e69ad1146.avif?t=1719508693\" width=600 height=337 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Assemble the team of heroes and recreate the epic quest line by taking on your friends in a series of fast-paced mini-games in this brand-new local multiplayer party game!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/319c130ed288f5805d37342d41d43ebe.poster.avif?t=1719508693\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/319c130ed288f5805d37342d41d43ebe.webm?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/319c130ed288f5805d37342d41d43ebe.mp4?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After completing their many adventures, the team of heroes meets at the tavern to brag about their great deeds in a relaxed atmosphere. It turns out that everyone remembers their role in saving the world in a slightly different way! It’s time to play a series of retrospective mini-games and show your friends who was (and still is) the best!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4-players local multiplayer!</strong></h2>Up to four players can enjoy the game through local multiplayer! Gather your friends, get some snacks and let’s party!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/a05f655bc42d3842d0473e4105764784.poster.avif?t=1719508693\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/a05f655bc42d3842d0473e4105764784.webm?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/a05f655bc42d3842d0473e4105764784.mp4?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mobile phones as controllers!</strong></h2>You can play the game using keyboard and gamepads, but if you don’t have as many – just grab your phone, download an app and use your mobile phone as controller!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your hero!</strong></h2>Choose from four heroes, various outfits and colourful skins to create your own character! Show other players who’s the best – with style!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/e76942d559391c122b2366718bb6088d.poster.avif?t=1719508693\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/e76942d559391c122b2366718bb6088d.webm?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/e76942d559391c122b2366718bb6088d.mp4?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your own adventure!</strong></h2>Every round vote for one of many different mini-games and re-live past adventures of your party! Fight the monsters, race for treasures, try to be the last-man-standing or bash your friends, every mini-game is a different experience! Also, every mini-game comes in two distinct versions!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy-to-learn action RPG gameplay!</strong></h2>Every mini-game is fast-paced and easy-to-learn, so everybody can get the controller and play! Challenge other players and get the highest score to win!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tested on friends and families!</strong></h2>We tested the game with variety of players to ensure everyone can find something for them and can play together to have fun!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/c5175b37ee3cf5b4f9b8c6e13bc50be3.poster.avif?t=1719508693\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/c5175b37ee3cf5b4f9b8c6e13bc50be3.webm?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/c5175b37ee3cf5b4f9b8c6e13bc50be3.mp4?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic fantasy retro style!</strong></h2>Every mini-game is set in one of the unique realms, and each is a tribute to games from golden era of pixel art!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reaction system!</strong></h2>After each mini-game enjoy humorous visual novel-style narration when characters trash-talk each other!", "about_the_game": "<strong>Assemble the team of heroes and recreate the epic quest line by taking on your friends in a series of fast-paced mini-games in this brand-new local multiplayer party game!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/319c130ed288f5805d37342d41d43ebe.poster.avif?t=1719508693\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024810/extras/319c130ed288f5805d37342d41d43ebe.webm?t=1719508693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so